# image 1
Style: Photography
Aspect Ratio: 1:1
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. An open paper packet of loose dry tea leaves resting on a plain wooden table, its curled dark leaves spilling into a shallow white porcelain dish beside it. A few loose leaves scattered on the wood grain, a simple porcelain teacup at the edge of the frame. Soft monochrome ink with faint warm sepia and pale jade tints, wet brush strokes, generous negative space, quiet studious mood. No text, no lettering, no labels.
